WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:11.340
<i>The appearance of the 107th Number...</i>

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.820
<i>When those two Galaxy-Eyes came together, I felt...</i>

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.110
<i>...something tremendous...</i>

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.620
<i>And the other Galaxy-Eyes user, Misael...</i>

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.280
<i>His true Barian form...</i>

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:33.910
<i>Does it mean they're getting serious now?</i>

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:40.020
<i>Yuma... Now your body and spirit are hurt.</i>

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.110
<i>And I, too...</i>

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:47.510
<i>It's likely because of the Sphere Field the Barian was using.</i>

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.600
<i>The damage I have taken requires me
 to take a rest in the Emperor's key.</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:58.370
<i>Yuma... If you keep this up, will your doubts and your fear...</i>

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:00.780
<i>...as well as your suffering is very likely to go on.</i>

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:06.340
<i>Though I feel happy that you suffer like this 
to try to protect me...</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.670
<i>But... but it's just to no avail.</i>

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:20.000
<i>I... still couldn't protect you, Astral...</i>

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.020
<i>Though I absolutely wanted to protect you...</i>

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.140
<i>Still... I...</i>

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.550
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:43.520
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.230
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:58.580
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:01.660
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:06.170
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.540
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:11.760
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.300
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.430
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.140
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.600
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.650
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:29.110
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:35.150
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.910
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.370
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:44.080
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:53.130
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.790
Man, I can't believe you!

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.830
You went to the Duel Lodge for fun and 
ended up falling off a cliff! What's <i>with</i> you?!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.960
And... Um... What about Ryouga-<i>kun</i>?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.800
"Awaken!! Yuma vs Shark: The Duel of Revival"

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.380
Even getting your friend involved into this...

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.970
You're such a goof!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.800
How can siblings be so different? Get a grip!

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:23.800
Rio-san said we'd better deal with this later on...

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.510
Though it's good you didn't get any broken bones-

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.980
Um, I beg your pardon...

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.020
My brother's here resting at the moment...

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.940
Would you mind being a bit more quiet?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.440
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.530
Well, I have to get to work. You behave yourself, got it!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.030
Understand?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.610
Yup...

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:46.740
Yuma-<i>kun</i>'s sister seemed like a very frightening person...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.700
She shrinks my cat courage...

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.580
She'll have trouble finding someone to marry, or not.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.000
Ain't that the truth!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.840
Guys, to summarize, we need to be quiet.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.300
Oh, my bad!

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:04.140
Don't worry. It was a lie, just now.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.930
Eh?

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.310
Your sister was really worried, too. The poor thing.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.940
Rio-<i>san</i>'s so intelligent and considerate.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.150
She's amazing.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.110
Hey, Rio. Close the curtain.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:21.860
But...

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:26.120
Having to see that wimpy bastard over there makes me sick.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.960
Tch... it's pissing me off.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.980
<i>What's the matter? You can't even stand up?</i>

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.310
<i>Then you can fall into a deep sleep of disgrace as you stay right there!</i>

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.360
<i>Tachyon Spiral of Destruction!</i>

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.080
A-A dream...

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.870
I... I...

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.630
Every night! I'm getting nightmares from your pathetic screaming!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.300
What's this about anyway? You're just pulling a gloomy face.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.670
Usually, you screw aro-

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.840
Hey!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:27.300
You guys! What time do you think it is?!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.310
That's bad, Brother!

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.810
Our friends are in the hospital and we haven't visited yet.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:39.610
I understand.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.280
Even if you're not going, I'll go.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:46.150
Wait... Where do you think you're going?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.990
I'm obviously going to visit Yuma!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.320
Kaito-<i>sama</i>, umm...

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:53.410
It's almost time for us to leave for the visit as you planned.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:58.170
Though it is such a waste for you to pay that stupid donkey a visit.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.210
Brother!

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.380
You'll be okay now.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.920
Young kids sure heal fast, don't they?

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.310
Irresolution is that jerk's reason
for being consumed by stress.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.240
Wha... what is this?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.490
I'm holding onto the Emperor's Key.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.700
If you want it back, you have to Duel with me.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.580
Don't run in the halls!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.250
I'm waiting on the roof.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.760
You're late, Yuma.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.090
What the heck are you pulling?!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:53.930
Why did you take the Emperor's Key?!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.850
Because nothing else will stop your crap!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:07:01.020
If you want this thing back, you have to beat me up in a Duel.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.810
Here I go!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.780
Duel Disk, set!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.290
D-Gazer, set.

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.710
<i>AR Vision: Link established.</i>

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.210
Duel!!

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:33.470
Yuma...

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.220
My turn! Draw!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.310
I set a Monster in Face-Down Defense Position!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.610
<i>I set Gogogo Golem...</i>

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.690
<i>I'll use this guy first to scope him out.</i>

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.740
I end my turn with this!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.280
What? That's how you end?!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:55.570
What are you thinking? You plan to win like <i>that</i>, jerk?

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.120
Tha... For now, that's my tac... my tac...

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.330
You can't even say the word <i>tactics</i> right?!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.330
Quit joking!

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.180
As I thought, talking to you is a waste of time.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.470
Now, come at me together with Astral!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.020
My turn! Draw!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.270
What's the matter? Won't Astral come out?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:29.360
Did he give up on your wimpy ways?

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.070
I activate the Magic Card, Fish Spawn!

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.870
With this card, I pay 1000 Life...

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.040
...to Special Summon two Fish-Spawn Tokens!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.380
I release the two Fish-Spawn Tokens...

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.930
...to Advance Summon the Level Nine Big Whale!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.640
When this Monster is Summoned,

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:02.560
all face-down Defense Position Monsters on the field are flipped face-up.

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.890
Big Ripple!

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.730
Then, with Big Whale's effect,

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:13.650
I can Special Summon a Level Four or lower
 Water-Attribute Monster from my hand!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.490
Come, Drill Barnacle!

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.950
Then I activate the Magic Card, Three Slice!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:28.420
With this card, I send the Level Nine Big Whale to the Graveyard,

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:32.380
divide his level by three, and select three Water-Attribute Monsters of the resulting level

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.380
and Special Summon them from my deck!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:38.010
Come, my three Starfishes!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.140
Don't tell me this is...

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.180
It's too late for you to be surprised <i>now</i>!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:49.480
I Overlay the two Level Three Starfishes!

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:54.490
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.030
Xyz Summon!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.070
Emerge from the deep bottom of the waters!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.540
Submersible Carrier Aero Shark!

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:10.580
Afterwards, I Overlay the Level Three Drill Barnacle and Starfish!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.460
You're Summoning another one?

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.050
Xyz Summon!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.590
The Crimson Lance coming out from the pitch-black darkness!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.550
Black Ray Lancer!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.140
Tha... that's...

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:27.310
... two Xyz Monsters?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:33.650
Here goes, Yuma. Aero-Shark's effect activates.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.570
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.490
for each card in my hand,

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.120
the opponent gets 400 points of damage inflicted.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.080
I've got two in my hand.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.580
Therefore, it's 800 points of damage!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.250
Air Torpedo!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.920
Then I activate Black Ray Lancer's effect.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.220
By detaching one Overlay Unit,

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.470
Gogogo Golem's effect is negated for this turn!

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:05.390
Paradise Lance!

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:10.640
Damn!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.770
Together with your Gogogo Golem,

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.650
you'll be destroyed!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.740
Big Eater!

00:11:24.330 --> 00:11:27.660
Now that I've stripped you blind, I'll give you one shot!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.580
Black Ray Lancer, attack Yuma directly!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.580
Black Spear!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:42.010
I'll leave you like that for now.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.220
I end my turn.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:49.730
Come on! It's your turn! No happy-go-lucky sleeping!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:53.940
My... my turn! Draw!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.900
Shark has two Xyz Monsters on his field.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.900
<i>But my field is completely empty.</i>

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:05.700
From my hand, I...

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.790
...Summon Gogogo Giant!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:17.840
Oh? Mustered up a bit of motivation, huh?

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.760
<i>Gogogo Giant has 2000 Attack Points.</i>

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.260
<i>He could even defeat the 1900 Attack Power Aero Shark,</i>

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:27.720
<i>but he can't defeat the 2100 Attack Power Black Ray Lancer.</i>

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.180
Okay, here goes...

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.020
Gogogo Giant's effect activates!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.230
When this Monster is Summoned,

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:39.860
I can Special Summon one Gogogo Golem
 in Defense Position from my Graveyard!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:44.910
Then, when this effect has been activated,
 Gogogo Giant changes to Defense Position.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:50.080
Then I activate the continuous Magic, Gogogo Gofu, from my hand!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.960
With this card, once per turn, a Gogogo Monster...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.870
cannot be destroyed by battle!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:01.880
Also, if there are two or more Gogogo Monsters, effect damage to the player is negated!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:08.390
Shark! With this, Aero Shark's effect, Air Torpedo, is sealed!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:10.510
With this, I end my turn!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:12.310
You're underestimating me, Yuma!

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.770
Right now, you're a gutless loser!

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:20.110
A guy without the courage to fight, who can't grasp a win!

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:22.990
Yuma...

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:28.780
Before us, the strongest enemy we ever met so far is standing in our way.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.990
Yuma, come to your senses.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.500
From now on, what will be the most essential thing for you and me?

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.630
My turn! Draw!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.800
I Summon the Level Five Panther Shark from my hand!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:51.350
This Monster, when there are two or more Monsters on the opponent's field,

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.310
can be Summoned without release!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.600
Come, Panther Shark!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.110
Then, when there is a Panther Shark on the field,

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.110
I can Special Summon this guy from my hand!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.820
Appear, Eagle Shark!

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:14.080
I overlay the Level Five Panther Shark and Eagle Shark!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.830
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.750
Xyz Summon!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.800
Tear the seas apart! Hatchery of the fierce Sharks!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.640
Appear, Shark Fortress!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.730
Thre... three Xyz Monsters!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.230
Now, things get serious from now on!

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:47.740
I equip Black Ray Lancer with the Equip Magic, Sharkize!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.410
A Monster equipped with this is treated as a Shark Monster,

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.960
and it gains 400 Attack Points!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.080
I detach one Overlay Unit...

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.460
...to activate Black Ray... no, Black Shark Lancer's effect!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.380
One Monster's effect is negated!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.010
With this, Gogogo Golem's effect is negated.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.640
Yuma, I'll beat the cowardice right out of your soul!

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:23.190
Aero Shark, attack Gogogo Giant!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.820
The effect of the Continuous Magic, Gogogo Gofu, activates!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.780
Once per turn, destruction by battle is negated!

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.950
Here comes the second shot!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:39.000
Black Shark Lancer, attack Gogogo Giant!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:46.090
Next, the third shot!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:50.130
Take this! Shark Fortress attacks Gogogo Golem!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:55.550
Gogogo Gofu's effect activates!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.810
So... somehow I survived this.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.110
You survived this?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:10.440
Don't make me laugh. Because I'm serious here!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.450
Shark Fortress' effect activates!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.080
By detaching one Overlay Unit from this Monster,

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:22.120
I increase the number of attacks of a Shark Monster except Shark Fortress by one!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.960
I choose Aero Shark!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:28.500
With this, Aero Shark can attack once again!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.840
Fang Reloaded!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.930
Aero Shark, attack Gogogo Golem!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.320
As you no longer have Gogogo Monsters on the field,

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.240
Gogogo Gofu is destroyed!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.240
Here comes another one.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.910
I activate Shark Fortress' Monster Effect!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:06.880
I detach one Overlay Unit, so a monster can attack once again!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.920
I choose Black Shark Lancer!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.510
Fang Reloaded!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.180
Black Shark Lancer, attack Yuma directly!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.270
This is the end!

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.360
<i>Is this... really the end?</i>

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.490
<i>Will I end up losing without doing anything?</i>

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.780
<i>Like back then...</i>

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.950
<i>...when I couldn't protect my most important thing
and was finished off?</i>

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.130
<i>I don't want this! I want to go further on!</i>

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.510
<i>And with him! I want to Duel with Astral!</i>

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.180
<i>I... I...</i>

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.850
I'll go on fighting, together with Astral!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:11.110
Yuma, I have been waiting for these words.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.900
A... Astral...

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:19.030
I'll help you out, but you're not protecting me.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:22.160
Me and you will be fighting together.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.910
Yuma, Gagaga Gardna!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.290
That's right...!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:30.880
From my hand, I Special Summon Gagaga Gardna!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:35.210
When receiving a Direct Attack, Gagaga Gardna...

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.800
...can be Special Summoned in Attack Position!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:40.390
Plus, by discarding one card from my hand,

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:44.140
this Monster's destruction by battle is negated!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.980
Even though you avoided the destruction of that Monster, 
you still get the damage!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:59.280
I'm ending my turn with his.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.030
Yuma, stand up!

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.530
Yes, I'm going to stand up again, and again!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:09.120
I'm fighting together with my friends to open a path to the future.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:10.870
Yuma...

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.050
My turn! Draw!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.380
It's here!

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:20.930
Yuma, the formula for victory is complete!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:21.840
Right!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.970
I Summon Ganbara Knight from my hand!

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:35.070
I Overlay the Level Four Gagaga Guard and Ganbara Knight!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:40.780
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.360
Xyz Summon!

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:44.780
Pennant of Light, appear!

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.540
The glorious Champion who slashes the darkness!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.660
Heroic Champion Excalibur!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.920
So it came.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.380
From my hand I activate the Equip Magic, Strongest Shield!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:03.140
When this card is equipped to
 a Warrior-Type Monster and it's in Attack Position,

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.470
its Defense Power is added to its Attack Power!

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:10.310
Excalibur's Defense Power is 2000, so its Attack Power is then 4000!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.980
4000 Attack Points!

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:16.520
However, my Life will barely be scratched by this!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:20.150
Then I'll activate Excalibur's effect!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:23.450
By detaching all its Overlay Units,

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:27.620
its Attack Power during this battle will be doubled!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.750
Go, Yuma!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.120
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.500
Excalibur, attack Shark Fortress!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.340
Sure Kill Thunder Strike!

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.360
<i>You can do it when you try.</i>

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:09.870
Shark!

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:12.870
You okay, Shark?

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:18.040
Shark, Yuma stood back up thanks to you.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:22.050
You're the one I have to thank for this. Thank you.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:26.220
What are you talking about? There's no reason for you to thank me.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:30.310
No, it was your purpose in this Duel from the start.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.970
Stupid bastard. It isn't like that.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:34.350
Huh?

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:38.060
Sha-Shark... He said you...

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.400
Why the hell are you getting so emotional?

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.610
That's what pisses me off about you!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.570
<i>Observation #22...</i>

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:52.330
<i>Occasionally, humans may not express their feelings without protest.</i>

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.710
<i>Be it as it is...</i>

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:07.130
<i>Friends are something good.</i>

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:24.570
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:32.240
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:39.830
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:47.170
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.720 --> 00:23:04.110
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:08.900
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:27.800
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:32.590
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:38.890
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:45.270
A bunch of guys brainwashed by Barian suddenly attack us!

00:23:45.270 --> 00:23:49.070
Just as we were in a desperately huge pinch, that guy came out of nowhere!

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.490
If we take attacks from this many Monsters...!

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:55.120
Alit! Why are you with a Barian?!

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.870
Everyone's really pumped up!

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.500
This is a continuation of our Duel from before!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.330
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:06.210
"A Lightning Speed Counter Battle!
 Alit, The Determined Fighter!"

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:08.880
I'll answer your challenge with everything I've got!
